  "title": "The Night Map Gains a Dimmer",
  "family": "learning",
  "category": "environment/ecology",
  "premise": "A town wants useful nighttime lighting, but a plan treating every lit area alike hides where light travels beyond its intended target. Comparing shielded and unshielded symbolic beams frames a reviewed discussion of tradeoffs.",
